### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Register User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "dev@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "Francis",
  "lastName": "Dev"
}

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Save Token from Login Response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Access Protected Route (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Create Category (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "slug": "electronics"
}

### 5. Get All Categories (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 6. Get Category By ID (Public)
# Replace <CATEGORY_ID> with an ID returned from Request 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/<CATEGORY_ID>

### 7. Create Product (Admin Only)
# Replace <CATEGORY_ID> with a real category UUID created earlier
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "categoryId": "<CATEGORY_ID>",
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB backlight, hot-swappable switches, Bluetooth 5.0",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stockQuantity": 25
}

### 8. Get All Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 9. Filter Products by Category (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId=<CATEGORY_ID>

### 10. Get Single Product by ID (Public)
# Replace <PRODUCT_ID> with a product UUID returned from Request 8
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/<PRODUCT_ID>

### 11. Place an Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "<YOUR_PRODUCT_ID>",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Get User Order History
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Get Single Order Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/<YOUR_ORDER_ID>
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Add Product to Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "productId": "<YOUR_PRODUCT_ID>",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 15. View User Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Update Cart Item Quantity
# Replace <CART_ITEM_ID> with the 'id' returned from Request 15
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cart/<CART_ITEM_ID>
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 17. Remove Single Item from Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/<CART_ITEM_ID>
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. Clear Entire Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. Create Stripe Checkout Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout/create-session
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}